                              Areafix Commands
                              ----------------
Command               Action                                 Example
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+                     Add echo if available                  +4DOS
-                     Remove echo                            -4DOS
%LIST                 Send list of echos you are already in  %LIST
%HELP                 Send this help file                    %HELP
%QUERY                Send list of echos  available to you   %QUERY
%+ALL                 Add all echos available                %+ALL
%-ALL                 Remove all echos                       %-ALL
%RESCAN               Reset message pointer                  %RESCAN 4DOS -2000

